{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:42 2026-05-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:42 2026-05-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:42 2026-05-20 HKT</p><p>大角咀發生刑毀案。今日（20日）下午12時31分，警方接獲報案，指連翔道對開的奧運站巴士總站，有多幅橫額和海報遭人破壞。人員到場後，發現現場最少11幅「禁止吸煙」的橫額和海報，被人惡意割爛。警方將案件列作刑事毀壞，正追緝涉案歹徒。</p><img alt=\"巴士站內多幅橫額和海報遭人割爛。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b44e2ccca3294b48a03924e4d02ba307/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巴士站內多幅橫額和海報遭人割爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f43205b1470134703f3b4853650bfe4e/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_01.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/027f8ce93ef8583869d29cb3768b9e42/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8101d33f31fac62a632587a3a1a8f8fb/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"多幅被割爛的的橫額和海報，指明巴士總站公共運輸設施禁止吸煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97eca1a264fa37c8d14ea37f13f0f7be/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f24800c06383bc1bf1fb9af3f5513f09/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa6fe3b05f51bcede757999c5bb9b1ed/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_08.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d529ce466b31586184328baf0825878/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_10.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a84ec1be77a855c1371be367163257a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_12.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a12a808833359834293b7bf4312ea413/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_13.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/544becae527fa30be887257d1df7167c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_14.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員在巴士總站調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b533a30264db7b1f3c696ef220165509/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260520_132115804_15.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T05:55:10.752622+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}